<div class="container">
  <div class="page-spacer">
    <div class="page">
      <h1 class="h1 text-center">Return & Refund</h1><div class="prose">
          <p>At Cozy Bliss, we pride ourselves in our product quality and are committed to your satisfaction. However, if you are unsatisfied with your purchase, we offer a straightforward return and refund process.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Return Eligibility</strong></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Returns are accepted <strong>within 30 days</strong> of purchase.</li>
<li>Items must be in new, unused, unwashed, and undamaged condition.</li>
<li>Original tags must be attached.</li>
<li>Items must be in their original packaging.</li>
<li>A valid proof of purchase (original receipt or gift receipt) is required.</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Return Process</strong></span></h3>
<h4><em>Initiate your return</em></h4>
<ul>
<li>Please contact our customer support team at<span style="text-decoration: underline;"> support@cozybliss.com. </span>
</li>
<li>Indicate the items you like the return and the reason.</li>
<li>Wait for return instructions.</li>
</ul>
<h4><em>Prepare your return</em></h4>
<ul>
<li>Package the item(s) securely in the original packaging.</li>
<li>Ensure items are free of stains, makeup, deodorant, or wear.</li>
<li>Include all original accessories and documentation.</li>
</ul>
<h4><em>Ship Your Return</em></h4>
<ul>
<li>Send the package to the address provided by Customer Service.</li>
<li>We recommend using a trackable shipping method.</li>
<li>Keep your proof of postage and tracking number for reference.</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Refund Process</strong></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Most returns are processed within 5-7 business days after receipt.</li>
<li>Refunds are typically processed within 14-21 business days of receiving your return.</li>
<li>The refunded amount will include the cost of the item(s) and any applicable sales tax.</li>
<li>Shipping costs are generally not refunded unless under extenuating circumstances.</li>
<li>Refunds for purchases with original receipts will be issued to the original form of payment.</li>
<li>The timing of the refund's appearance on your statement depends on your financial institution.</li>
<li>Returns with gift receipts will receive a Merchandise Credit for the amount on the receipt.</li>
<li>A $10 USD($15 CAD) return fee will be deducted from your refund amount.</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Return Shipping Cost</strong></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>For returns due to personal preference or incorrect purchases, the customer is responsible for return shipping costs.</li>
<li>If you received a damaged or incorrect item, Cozy Bliss will cover the return shipping fee. Please email clear photos of the issue to our Customer Service team before initiating the return.</li>
</ul>
<h4><b>Special circumstances</b></h4>
<ul>
<li>Damaged, defective, or incorrect items must be reported within 7 days of delivery.</li>
<li>We are not liable for returned packages lost or stolen in transit.</li>
</ul>
<h4><strong>Exchanges</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>We do not offer direct exchanges.</li>
<li>You're welcome to return your item(s) and repurchase in your desired size or color.</li>
</ul>
<h4><strong>Non-Returnable Items</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>Items that have been worn, altered, laundered, or damaged after receipt.</li>
<li>Items returned without original packaging or tags.</li>
<li>Items received after the 30-day return window.</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Reserved Rights</strong></h3>
<p><span>Cozy Bliss</span> reserves the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Limit or refuse returns from customers with</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ol>
<li>Excessive returns history indicative of "wardrobing,"</li>
<li>History of returning worn, altered, laundered, damaged, or incomplete items;</li>
<li>Suspected fraudulent or criminal activity</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>Refuse service to any customer or entity due to similar actions as noted above.</li>
<li>Discard any non-<span>Cozy Bliss</span> items sent to our Distribution Center.</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Questions or Concerns</strong></h3>
<p>If you have any questions about our Return &amp; Refund Policy, please contact our Customer Service team.</p>
<p>By purchasing <span>Cozy Bliss</span>, you agree to the terms of this Return &amp; Refund Policy. We reserve the right to modify this policy at any time without prior notice. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting on our website.</p>
        </div></div>
  </div>
</div>

</section>
